{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-96","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与比例","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a sixth apotome, the side of the area is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole.","book":10,"number":96,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":96,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","contentId":"euclid-10-96","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"405b2198f8d5a2786faa4ccf50e1cc4cdc8867ab1bf240b3b7589f575e032d80","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-96.statement","euclid-10-96.construction.1","euclid-10-96.construction.2","euclid-10-96.proof.1","euclid-10-96.construction.3","euclid-10-96.proof.2","euclid-10-96.proof.3","euclid-10-96.proof.4","euclid-10-96.proof.5","euclid-10-96.proof.6","euclid-10-96.proof.7","euclid-10-96.construction.4","euclid-10-96.proof.8","euclid-10-96.proof.9","euclid-10-96.proof.10","euclid-10-96.proof.11","euclid-10-96.proof.12","euclid-10-96.proof.13","euclid-10-96.proof.14","euclid-10-96.conclusion","euclid-10-96.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-96.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c77eca2a8d01cfcac7b5ba2ee35a6e4173467ad2dce86477c371c6cdb871d07","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a sixth apotome, the side of the area is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第六截差无理线段组成,则该区域一侧为直线,中项无理线段区域为中项无理线段整片。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79f5dfba3ad50561a28a24a6c88f0a04abb93489d37d7e5142d415d53988a273","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AB be contained by the rational straight line AC and the sixth apotome AD; I say that the side of the area AB is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB区由有理线段 AC和6 截差无理线段 AD组成;我说,AB区是一条直线,中项无理线段区中项无理线段个整片面积。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fcae6fe3d853fc5c8521fcda60c04a84dad9f99faf749ba6e7a35c2fcc7a3b65","citations":["euclid-10-def-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DG be the annex to AD; therefore AG, GD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, neither of them is commensurable in length with the rational straight line AC set out, and the square on the whole AG is greater than the square on the annex DG by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with AG. [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG是AD的附件;因此,AG,GD是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,其中任何一个都没有长度可公度,有理线段 AC是列出的,而正方形是整个AG,比附件DG的正方形长正方形,长不可公度,长AG。 [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5057373ee857fecc8033c5d852f0e39726ce2dcc4c16e58064a3386649f74073","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the square on AG is greater than the square on GD by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with AG, therefore, if there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on DG and deficient by a square figure, it will divide it into incommensurable parts. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果对AG a 平行四边形的DG和DG的4部分适用等于正方形的DG, 并有正方形的缺陷,则分为不可公度部分。（相关点与线段：GD） [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f440ab69e1001dab77696339a9dc41c66cf787ffb778b43b949eb1ba2c107fcc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then DG be bisected at E, let there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the square on EG and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AF, FG; therefore AF is incommensurable in length with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG两部分为E,EG对AGa 平行四边形对EG对EG,有正方形对正方形,有缺陷,矩形、AF、FG对AF对不可公度对FG对DG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6c5b0c7d7050064556be1877efb1a3dc7084ce46d1fe62902776a18cd60bbd8","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AF is to FG, so is AI to FK. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore AI is incommensurable with FK. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AF对FG的比等于AI对FK的比,因此,AI对FK的比是不可公度对FK；AF 与 FG 之比等于 AI 与 FK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7343028fa2e427ba25b48f57fd0041ff925c15bfb099e3952280f3281029d665","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG, AC are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, AK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG,AC是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AK是中项无理线段 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48b2bd8e6dcc9e109ebbec5d288a8824433eabe98f90bfafbe889e6a82f65808","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AC, DG are rational straight lines and incommensurable in length, DK is also medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,AC、DG和有理线段的长度分别为有理线段和不可公度,DK和中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"627497262980cd6729f2bd9e7c657b7ecc543f5bbcb10fbb18157535e7277ec6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AG, GD are commensurable in square only, therefore AG is incommensurable in length with GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AG,GD是平方可公度而长度不可公度,AG是不可公度,GD是GD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ad8d13c386134765b8e8f8558b3c7659f7369ecdc41115f7e2d87f75b595ae8","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AG is to GD, so is AK to KD; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore AK is incommensurable with KD. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AG对GD的比等于AK对KD的比;因此,AK对KD的比是不可公度对KD；AG 与 GD 之比等于 AK 与 KD 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"536580000455654c3e19173a095fba5981a1f65d1a259c5c47c3e3c0e08bc430","citations":["euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square LM be constructed equal to AI, and let NO equal to FK, and about the same angle, be subtracted; therefore the squares LM, NO are about the same diameter. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,正方形 LM的构造等于AI,NO等于FK,而同一角度的计算则要减去;因此,正方形 LM,NO的直径大致相同。 [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72802f1b081a1ac963339b24e8028c256c6eb4278fd7cbc008025d669220eb2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let PR be their diameter, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让PR是直径, 让图绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42046f1f485282d19bdbfef541aa12477bb86fbcc6b4a8448c5b8943c4110f2a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then in manner similar to the above we can prove that LN is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,以与上述相似的方式,我们可以证明LN是AB区的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0faa0cb938f460ecb06d98eda1abf4ae3103914a9db0c44bb17e38b7d54f5ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that LN is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说LN是一条直线,中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个整条线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"551a739a88ea04b4479dda0bfa3f0e9ed45db5cf0ab2a3b765e155fce969cd28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AK was proved medial and is equal to the squares on LP, PN, therefore the sum of the squares on LP, PN is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AK项被证明为中项无理线段项,相当于LP项对LP项对PN项,因此,LP项对LP项对PN项对中项无理线段项对中项无理线段项对中项无理线段项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"380b3f8c3c08fbdecb45e412e7d9dd26edea48c963295785b47e6e9c9c0b0d5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DK was proved medial and is equal to twice the rectangle LP, PN, twice the rectangle LP, PN is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DK被证明为中项无理线段, 相当于矩形 LP, PN的两倍, 也是矩形 LP, PN的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37bf7739356ca1cb73e7d8e5284f2ef60dda04872573dab1582315ec9662c669","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AK was proved incommensurable with DK, the squares on LP, PN are also incommensurable with twice the rectangle LP, PN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AKAKDK LPLPPN不可公度 也是不可公度 也是矩形LP的两倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed4dbadd80af478c58e746213bdee29aa84a142d1f399b613f891461e59ac52a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AI is incommensurable with FK, therefore the square on LP is also incommensurable with the square on PN; therefore LP, PN are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, twice the rectangle contained by them medial, and further the squares on them incommensurable with twice the rectangle contained by them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AI是不可公度,FK,LP的正方形也是不可公度,PN是正方形;因此,LP,PN是正方形的直线不可公度,正方形是正方形的正方形,中项无理线段的正方形,是中项无理线段的矩形,是正方形的两倍,正方形是不可公度,不可公度的正方形,是矩形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"273ccfca311a89304a6e081f0c4632dfecf3fff1862b9f549444f5da6c097e27","citations":["euclid-10-78"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore LN is the irrational straight line called that which produces with a medial area a medial whole; [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)] and it is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LN是无理线段,中项无理线段区域生产中项无理线段个整片;它是AB区域一侧。 [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":19,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6be77ea47839d75f270c1ecc2ecd1a523ab92a6001cc7e2395e7790f67b2b1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area is a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,该地区的一面是一条直线,中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个整块。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-96.source","contentId":"euclid-10-96","revisionId":"euclid-10-96@raw-405b2198f8d5a278","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"210427811e887f1dac8cf0dc975ff941b306e26489a569b0a0cb5bbce8e99069","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-96:euclid-10-def-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-96","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-96.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96/","sourceLabel":"X. Deff. III. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-96:euclid-10-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-96","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-96.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.96/","sourceLabel":"X. 18"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-96:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-96","sourceBlockIds":["